---
import { sharedPeople, sharedById, sharedCounts, ADAM, MARK, FRED_RICHARD, personUrl } from '../data/shared-family';
import { sharedGraph } from '../scripts/family/shared-graph';
import { familyMapPeople, familyMapById, familyMapKnownCount, mapProfileUrl, mapPersonLabel, mapEdgeAssessment } from '../data/family-map';
import { biblicalPeople, biblicalById } from '../data/biblical-family';
const namedPeople = familyMapPeople.filter(p => p.kind !== 'unknown');
const unknownPeople = familyMapPeople.filter(p => p.kind === 'unknown');
const graph=sharedGraph(ADAM, undefined, familyMapById, mapEdgeAssessment);
---
<section class="shared-tree family-enhanced" data-shared-tree>
  <div class="shared-tree-intro"><p><strong>{sharedCounts.people} people · {sharedCounts.families} families.</strong> Explore the Muncie, Stockwell and Crook branches alongside 18 additional Italian research people 21 named biblical people, and one provisional medieval candidate. Unknown parents appear as ? positions.</p><p>Adam (Tom) → Patrick → <strong>Mark Allen Stockwell</strong>. Gloria’s later family with Fred Richard Muncie appears alongside this line. Partner lines do not imply parentage.</p></div>
  <section class="family-origin" aria-labelledby="family-origin-heading"><span class="editorial-kicker">The ancestry goal</span><h2 id="family-origin-heading">Adam &amp; Eve to Tom</h2><div class="family-origin-route"><a href="/family/?focus=bible-abram">Adam &amp; Eve<small>{biblicalPeople.length} named biblical people · Genesis 4, 5 &amp; 11</small></a><div class="family-origin-gap"><strong>?</strong><span>Connection unknown</span><small>Number of missing generations unknown</small></div><a href="#ancestry-journey">Tom’s recorded family<small>Explore the known trails and their missing parents</small></a></div><p>Both branches are included in the map below. <a href="/family/?view=all#shared-tree-heading">Show every recorded branch, including Adam &amp; Eve ↗</a> The ? marks a research gap; no parent link joins the biblical branch to Tom’s recorded ancestors yet.</p></section>
  <section class="family-explorer" aria-labelledby="shared-tree-heading">
    <div class="family-map-header"><div><span class="editorial-kicker">The wider family</span><h2 id="shared-tree-heading" data-shared-title>Tom’s family</h2></div><span class="family-map-count" data-shared-count>{graph.nodes.filter(n=>familyMapById[n.id].kind!=='unknown').length} people · {graph.nodes.filter(n=>familyMapById[n.id].kind==='unknown').length} ? positions / {familyMapKnownCount} named people</span></div>
    <div class="family-toolbar">
      <div class="family-search-wrap"><label class="sr-only" for="shared-search">Find anyone in the complete family tree</label><input id="shared-search" type="search" placeholder={`Search ${familyMapKnownCount} named people or ?…`} autocomplete="off" aria-controls="shared-results" /><div class="family-search-results" data-shared-popup hidden><p role="status" data-shared-status></p><ul id="shared-results"></ul></div></div>
      <div class="family-zoom-controls"><button type="button" data-shared-out aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><output data-shared-zoom aria-label="Zoom level">100%</output><button type="button" data-shared-in aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button type="button" data-shared-fit>Fit view</button><button type="button" data-shared-whole>Whole tree</button><button type="button" data-shared-fullscreen>Full screen</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="family-map-options shared-options"><fieldset><legend class="sr-only">Family branches</legend><label>Show <select data-shared-depth aria-label="Tree scope"><option value="1">1 generation</option><option value="2" selected>2 generations</option><option value="3">3 generations</option><option value="4">4 generations</option><option value="30">All my recorded ancestors</option><option value="all">All recorded people &amp; biblical branch</option></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" data-shared-children checked /> Children</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-shared-siblings /> Siblings</label></fieldset><button type="button" data-shared-reset>Reset</button></div>
    <div class="shared-shortcuts"><span>Start with:</span><button type="button" data-shared-focus={ADAM}>Tom</button><button type="button" data-shared-focus={MARK}>Stockwell</button><button type="button" data-shared-focus={FRED_RICHARD}>Muncie</button><button type="button" data-shared-focus="bible-seth">Adam &amp; Eve</button><a href="#ancestry-journey">Ancestry trails ↓</a><a href="#italian-research">Italian research ↓</a></div>
    <div class="family-map-stage" data-shared-stage tabindex="0" aria-label="Complete family tree. Arrow keys pan; plus and minus zoom; Home fits the view." aria-describedby="shared-map-help"><div class="family-map-world" data-shared-world style={`width:${graph.width}px;height:${graph.height}px`}>
      <svg class="family-map-lines" data-shared-lines width={graph.width} height={graph.height} aria-hidden="true">{graph.edges.map(e=><path d={e.path} data-kind={e.kind} data-confidence={e.confidence} data-source={e.sourceKind} />)}</svg><div class="family-generation-labels" data-shared-labels aria-hidden="true">{graph.generations.map(g=><span style={`top:${g.y-14}px`}>{g.label}</span>)}</div>
      {familyMapPeople.map(p=>{const n=graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===p.id);return <a class="family-map-person" data-shared-person={p.id} data-person-kind={p.kind} href={mapProfileUrl(p.id)} hidden={!n} style={n?`left:${n.x}px;top:${n.y}px`:undefined} title={mapPersonLabel(p.id)} aria-label={`${mapPersonLabel(p.id)}, ${p.dates}. Open person details.`}><span class="family-node-name">{p.id===ADAM?'Adam Muncie (Tom)':p.name}</span><span class="family-node-dates">{p.dates}</span><span class="family-node-alias">{p.kind==='biblical'?'Biblical narrative · source ↗':p.kind==='unknown'?p.aliases[0]:p.kind==='research'?'Research person · evidence ↗':p.kind==='candidate'?'Provisional candidate · source ↗':p.id===MARK?'Tom’s grandfather':p.id===ADAM?'Starting person':p.aliases[0]||'Open profile ↗'}</span></a>})}
    </div><span class="family-map-watermark">Muncie & Crook</span></div>
    <div class="family-map-footer"><div class="shared-key"><span>Parent / child</span><span class="shared-key-partner">Partners</span><span class="shared-key-probable">Probable research link</span><span class="shared-key-review">? / parent link under review</span><span class="shared-key-biblical">Biblical narrative</span></div><p id="shared-map-help">Drag to move · pinch or Ctrl + scroll to zoom · arrow keys navigate cards</p></div>
    <details class="shared-evidence-note"><summary>About these connections</summary><p class="family-map-note">Connections are explicitly recorded in the family tree. The original records behind its citations have not all been inspected. Biological or adoptive status is left unspecified where the tree does not state it. Dotted parent lines mark specific links with unresolved research conflicts; their family-provided assertions remain preserved. Solid parent lines mean recorded in the family account, not that every original record has been checked. Biblical lines come from Genesis and remain disconnected from the recorded family. A ? card is an unknown immediate parent position, not an identified person. Rows arrange the map for reading; they do not align dates between the branches. Italian research is included in this map: dashed probable links and dotted provisional links retain their original confidence labels, source types and explanations in person details.</p></details>
  </section>
  <details class="family-fallback"><summary>Browse every person as a list</summary><ul class="shared-directory">{namedPeople.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.name.localeCompare(b.name)).map(p=><li><a href={mapProfileUrl(p.id)}>{p.name}</a><small>{p.dates}</small></li>)}</ul></details>
  <details class="family-fallback" data-map-gaps><summary>Browse all {unknownPeople.length} ? parent positions</summary><p>Each ? belongs to one immediate unfilled parent position. Earlier unknown generations are not counted or invented.</p><ul class="shared-directory">{unknownPeople.map(p=><li id={`map-${p.id}`}><strong>? · {p.aliases[0]}</strong><p>Identity, dates and relationship status unknown.</p><a href={mapProfileUrl(p.child!)}>Recorded child: {familyMapById[p.child!].name} ↗</a></li>)}</ul></details>
  <dialog class="family-dialog shared-person-dialog" data-shared-dialog aria-label="Family person details"><div class="family-profiles"><div class="family-detail-header"><h2>Person details</h2><button type="button" data-shared-close aria-label="Close person details">×</button></div><article class="family-profile"><span class="editorial-kicker" data-shared-kind>Family records</span><h3 data-shared-person-name tabindex="-1"></h3><p class="family-aliases" data-shared-dates></p><p class="family-aliases" data-shared-aliases></p><button type="button" class="shared-explore" data-shared-explore>Explore their branches</button><a class="shared-profile-link" data-shared-profile href={personUrl(ADAM)}>Full profile, events & sources ↗</a><div data-shared-relatives></div><p class="shared-provenance" data-shared-provenance>Full profiles include every recorded date, place, note and citation. Conflicting entries remain separate.</p></article></div></dialog>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/shared-family-tree';</script>
